{"3928320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wilderness Trials: Alpha Wolf", "steam_appid": 3928320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/d97bd24bb9d18201dd188223fe34b989.poster.avif?t=1756334649\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/d97bd24bb9d18201dd188223fe34b989.webm?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/d97bd24bb9d18201dd188223fe34b989.mp4?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the vast wilderness, embark on a journey that belongs to the wolf. Wind sweeps over the highlands, mist rises from the valleys, and soft light spills through the forest. Seasons change, day turns to night, and all life weaves together on this land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/77a5ea56c8e3af608886ef34977df683.poster.avif?t=1756334649\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/77a5ea56c8e3af608886ef34977df683.webm?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/77a5ea56c8e3af608886ef34977df683.mp4?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no marked paths, no set missions. You are free to explore forests, canyons, grasslands, and hidden caves, to feel the shifting weather and the flow of time, and to observe the tracks of creatures, following their trails. Sometimes, patience is your greatest ally. At other moments, thrilling encounters will unfold without warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/7e4163f8921126b2618198bfbdf60761.poster.avif?t=1756334649\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/7e4163f8921126b2618198bfbdf60761.webm?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/7e4163f8921126b2618198bfbdf60761.mp4?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive in the wild, you must find food, drink, and shelter. Travel between secluded dens, gather scattered items, build your own resting place, store provisions safely, and protect it from predators as night falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/267d526056437c20f679e6d1292c5ed3.poster.avif?t=1756334649\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/267d526056437c20f679e6d1292c5ed3.webm?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/267d526056437c20f679e6d1292c5ed3.mp4?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deeper still, ancient trials lie hidden, forgotten by time. Tied to the life of this land, they test your instincts and will, guiding you step by step toward higher mastery. Complete them all, and you may stand atop the peaks, becoming the true guardian and ruler of this wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world awaits your exploration, your challenges, and the stories you carve for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/1010892ca3c9c35914faced9771c4400.poster.avif?t=1756334649\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/1010892ca3c9c35914faced9771c4400.webm?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/1010892ca3c9c35914faced9771c4400.mp4?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✦ Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansive Open World</strong> — Roam freely across forests, grasslands, canyons, and hidden caves, with every journey filled with discovery.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Seasons and Weather</strong> — Experience spring, summer, autumn, and winter; sunrise and sunset; wind, rain, and starry skies; feel the pulse of nature.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Authentic Wildlife</strong> — Wolves, bears, deer, rabbits, wild boars, foxes, and more share this land, each with distinct behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Survival</strong> — Hunt, drink, rest, and build dens, adapting to the rhythms of the wilderness and safeguarding your resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Hunting Styles</strong> — Track prey with patience or cooperate with companions to take down stronger creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Ancient Power</strong> — Discover ancient stone monuments scattered across the land and draw upon the forces of nature to enhance yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Trials</strong> — Seven hidden challenges await, testing your instincts and wisdom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Companionship</strong> — Venture alone but summon allies along the way to share in the power of the wild.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect Your Den</strong> — Establish and strengthen your resting place, safeguarding food and territory against predators.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/d97bd24bb9d18201dd188223fe34b989.poster.avif?t=1756334649\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/d97bd24bb9d18201dd188223fe34b989.webm?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/d97bd24bb9d18201dd188223fe34b989.mp4?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the vast wilderness, embark on a journey that belongs to the wolf. Wind sweeps over the highlands, mist rises from the valleys, and soft light spills through the forest. Seasons change, day turns to night, and all life weaves together on this land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/77a5ea56c8e3af608886ef34977df683.poster.avif?t=1756334649\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/77a5ea56c8e3af608886ef34977df683.webm?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/77a5ea56c8e3af608886ef34977df683.mp4?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no marked paths, no set missions. You are free to explore forests, canyons, grasslands, and hidden caves, to feel the shifting weather and the flow of time, and to observe the tracks of creatures, following their trails. Sometimes, patience is your greatest ally. At other moments, thrilling encounters will unfold without warning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/7e4163f8921126b2618198bfbdf60761.poster.avif?t=1756334649\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/7e4163f8921126b2618198bfbdf60761.webm?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/7e4163f8921126b2618198bfbdf60761.mp4?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive in the wild, you must find food, drink, and shelter. Travel between secluded dens, gather scattered items, build your own resting place, store provisions safely, and protect it from predators as night falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/267d526056437c20f679e6d1292c5ed3.poster.avif?t=1756334649\" width=768 height=432 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/267d526056437c20f679e6d1292c5ed3.webm?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/extras/267d526056437c20f679e6d1292c5ed3.mp4?t=1756334649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vid