ing Styles</strong> — Track prey with patience or cooperate with companions to take down stronger creatures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration and Ancient Power</strong> — Discover ancient stone monuments scattered across the land and draw upon the forces of nature to enhance yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Trials</strong> — Seven hidden challenges await, testing your instincts and wisdom.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Companionship</strong> — Venture alone but summon allies along the way to share in the power of the wild.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect Your Den</strong> — Establish and strengthen your resting place, safeguarding food and territory against predators.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Explore a vast wilderness where every path is yours to choose. Hunt, survive, and uncover ancient trials hidden deep within forgotten lands. Follow the call of instinct, awaken nature’s power, and carve your journey to become the true guardian of the wild.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/ada893d033d37a47dbe85f51c8e1719556d9ab5d/header.jpg?t=1756334649", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/c603ef62ffab551a00913e112491aa04fe0af9c0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756334649", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3928320/c603ef62ffab551a00913e112491aa04fe0af9c0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756334649", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-2500K / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></l